  "View Live Demo": "عرض تجريبي مباشر",
  "Introducing the Helpdesk Module of EcommerceGo SaaS": "تقديم وحدة مكتب المساعدة الخاصة بـ EcommerceGo SaaS",
  "Welcome to our Helpdesk Module, a robust solution designed to facilitate seamless communication between businesses and super admins. Easily manage customer inquiries, bug reports, and product-related issues through our intuitive interface, complete with attachment support for comprehensive ticket handling. Engage in real-time chat for instant issue resolution and efficient collaboration, ensuring a superior customer service experience.": "مرحبًا بك في وحدة مكتب المساعدة الخاصة بنا، وهو حل قوي مصمم لتسهيل التواصل السلس بين الشركات والمشرفين المتميزين. ",
  "Unified Ticket Management": "إدارة التذاكر الموحدة",
  "The Helpdesk Module consolidates customer inquiries into a unified ticketing system, enabling businesses to efficiently track, prioritize, and resolve tickets from a single platform. This centralized approach ensures that support agents can manage all inquiries effectively, enhancing responsiveness and preventing any issues from being overlooked. By streamlining ticket management, businesses can optimize their support workflows and deliver timely resolutions to customer queries.": "تعمل وحدة مكتب المساعدة على دمج استفسارات العملاء في نظام موحد للتذاكر، مما يمكّن الشركات من تتبع التذاكر وتحديد أولوياتها وحلها بكفاءة من منصة واحدة. ",
  "Streamlined Customer Support": "دعم العملاء المبسط",
